description: Conventions for Next.js localized app pages and layouts.
globs: app/**/*.tsx
alwaysApply: false
---

# Localized App Pages

- Preserve locale-aware routing under `app/[locale]/...`.
- Prefer server components by default; use client components only when required.
- For navigation, use project i18n wrappers from `i18n/routing.ts` when locale-aware links are needed.
- Keep page-level data and side effects close to the route boundary.

# UI Composition

- Build feature UI from existing primitives in `components/ui/`.
- Keep page components focused; move reusable logic to `components/` or `hooks/`.
- Avoid adding route-specific styling systems when shared styles already exist.

# Safety

- Do not break existing locale paths or implicit redirects managed by middleware.
- Maintain compatibility with existing app-level providers.
